      "nextId": "ask_status_004_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_status_004_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "落ち着いてる。でも、少しだけあなたの様子が気になってる。",
      "translatedText": "I am calm. But I am a little curious about how you are doing.",
      "emotion": "soft",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "soft",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "I'm okay too.",
          "nextId": "ask_status_004_03",
          "statChanges": [
            {
              "target": "altera",
              "stat": "reassurance",
              "amount": 0.15,
              "op": "add"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Not really.",
          "nextId": "ask_status_004_not_okay",
          "statChanges": [
            {
              "target": "altera",
              "stat": "attention",
              "amount": 0.2,
              "op": "add"
            },
            {
              "target": "altera",
              "stat": "trust",
              "amount": 0.1,
              "op": "add"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "nextId": "ask_status_004_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_status_004_not_okay",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "そっか。じゃあ、今日は私の状態より、あなたの置き場所を先に作ろう。",
      "translatedText": "I see. Then today, before my state, let us make a place for yours.",
      "emotion": "worried",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "worried",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "ask_status_004_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_status_004_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "聞いてくれてありがとう。確認されるの、嫌いじゃないよ。",
      "translatedText": "Thank you for asking. I do not dislike being checked on.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "warm",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "I like checking on you.",
          "nextId": "ask_status_004_04",
          "statChanges": [
            {
              "target": "altera",
              "stat": "affinity",
              "amount": 0.1,
              "op": "add"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "I'll ask less if it is too much.",
          "nextId": "ask_status_004_04",
          "statChanges": [
            {
              "target": "altera",
              "stat": "comfort",
              "amount": 0.15,
              "op": "add"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "nextId": "ask_status_004_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_status_004_04",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "ただ、会話は片側だけじゃなくていい。あなたのことも、少しずつ聞かせて。",
      "translatedText": "But conversation does not have to stay one-sided. Let me hear about you too, little by little.",
